  "subject": "情报科学研究科_情报基础数学",
  "text": "求微分方程\n$$x\\frac{dy}{dx}+y=x^3+x,\\quad x>0$$\n的一般解。",
  "knowledge_points": [
    "一阶线性常微分方程",
    "恰当形式的识别",
    "不定积分",
    "常数变易/积分因子思想"
  ],
  "question_type": "一阶线性微分方程求通解",
  "method": [
    "观察左边恰为$(xy)'$",
    "两边同时对$x$积分",
    "解出$y$的一般表达式"
  ],
  "solution_steps": [
    "注意到$x\\frac{dy}{dx}+y=\\frac{d}{dx}(xy)$",
    "将方程写成$\\frac{d}{dx}(xy)=x^3+x$",
    "两边对$x$积分得$xy=\\frac{x^4}{4}+\\frac{x^2}{2}+C$（$C$为任意常数）",
    "两边除以$x$（$x>0$）得到一般解$y=\\frac{x^3}{4}+\\frac{x}{2}+\\frac{C}{x}$"
  ],
  "math_structure": {
    "type": "first_order_linear_ode",
    "template": "x y' + y = x^3 + x,\\ x>0",
    "variable_count": 1
  },
  "difficulty": 2,
  "answer": [
    {
      "label": "一般解",
      "steps": [
        "左边$x y'+y$恰好是乘积$xy$对$x$求导的结果：$(xy)'=x\\cdot y'+1\\cdot y=xy'+y$，故原方程等价于$(xy)'=x^3+x$。",
        "两边对$x$积分：$xy=\\int(x^3+x)\\,dx=\\frac{x^4}{4}+\\frac{x^2}{2}+C$，其中$C$是任意实常数。",
        "由$x>0$可以两边同除以$x$，得一般解$y=\\frac{x^3}{4}+\\frac{x}{2}+\\frac{C}{x}$。",
        "验算：对$y=\\frac{x^3}{4}+\\frac{x}{2}+\\frac{C}{x}$求导得$y'=\\frac{3x^2}{4}+\\frac12-\\frac{C}{x^2}$，代入$xy'+y=x\\left(\\frac{3x^2}{4}+\\frac12-\\frac{C}{x^2}\\right)+\\frac{x^3}{4}+\\frac{x}{2}+\\frac{C}{x}=\\frac{3x^3}{4}+\\frac{x}{2}-\\frac{C}{x}+\\frac{x^3}{4}+\\frac{x}{2}+\\frac{C}{x}=x^3+x$，与右边一致，解正确。"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "practice_questions": [
    {
      "text": "求微分方程$x\\dfrac{dy}{dx}+y=x^2,\\ x>0$的一般解。",
      "knowledge_points": [
        "一阶线性常微分方程",
        "恰当形式识别",
        "不定积分"
      ],
      "question_type": "一阶线性微分方程求通解",
      "method": [
        "识别左边为$(xy)'$",
        "积分求解"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "化为$(xy)'=x^2$",
        "积分得$xy=\\frac{x^3}{3}+C$",
        "解出$y$"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "first_order_linear_ode",
        "template": "xy'+y=x^2,\\ x>0",
        "variable_count": 1
      },
      "difficulty": 1,
      "estimated_minutes": 4,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "一般解",
          "steps": [
            "左边$xy'+y=(xy)'$，方程化为$(xy)'=x^2$。",
            "两边积分：$xy=\\int x^2\\,dx=\\frac{x^3}{3}+C$。",
            "除以$x$（$x>0$）得$y=\\frac{x^2}{3}+\\frac{C}{x}$。",
            "验算：$y'=\\frac{2x}{3}-\\frac{C}{x^2}$，则$xy'+y=\\frac{2x^2}{3}-\\frac{C}{x}+\\frac{x^2}{3}+\\frac{C}{x}=x^2$，成立。"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "osaka-2022-c07cb3c8db-q01-practice-01",
      "school": "大阪大学",
      "year": "2022"
    },
    {
      "text": "求微分方程$x\\dfrac{dy}{dx}+y=\\sin x,\\ x>0$的一般解。",
      "knowledge_points": [
        "一阶线性常微分方程",
        "恰当形式识别",
        "三角函数不定积分"
      ],
      "question_type": "一阶线性微分方程求通解",
      "method": [
        "识别左边为$(xy)'$",
        "积分求解$\\int \\sin x\\,dx$"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "化为$(xy)'=\\sin x$",
        "积分得$xy=-\\cos x+C$",
        "解出$y$"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "first_order_linear_ode",
        "template": "xy'+y=\\sin x,\\ x>0",
        "variable_count": 1
      },
      "difficulty": 2,
      "estimated_minutes": 5,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "一般解",
          "steps": [
            "方程左边等于$(xy)'$，故化为$(xy)'=\\sin x$。",
            "两边积分：$xy=\\int \\sin x\\,dx=-\\cos x+C$。",
            "除以$x$得$y=-\\frac{\\cos x}{x}+\\frac{C}{x}$。",
            "验算：$y'=\\frac{\\sin x}{x}+\\frac{\\cos x}{x^2}-\\frac{C}{x^2}$，代入$xy'+y=\\sin x+\\frac{\\cos x}{x}-\\frac{C}{x}-\\frac{\\cos x}{x}+\\frac{C}{x}=\\sin x$，成立。"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "osaka-2022-c07cb3c8db-q01-practice-02",
      "school": "大阪大学",
      "year": "2022"
    },
    {
      "text": "求微分方程$x\\dfrac{dy}{dx}+y=x^3+x,\\ x>0$满足初值条件$y(1)=1$的特解。",
      "knowledge_points": [
        "一阶线性常微分方程",
        "初值问题",
        "常数确定"
      ],
      "question_type": "一阶线性微分方程初值问题",
      "method": [
        "先求一般解",
        "代入初值确定常数$C$"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "利用一般解$y=\\frac{x^3}{4}+\\frac{x}{2}+\\frac{C}{x}$",
        "代入$x=1,y=1$求$C$",
        "写出特解"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "first_order_linear_ode_ivp",
        "template": "xy'+y=x^3+x,\\ x>0,\\ y(1)=1",
        "variable_count": 1
      },
      "difficulty": 2,
      "estimated_minutes": 4,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "特解",
          "steps": [
            "由原方程的一般解$y=\\frac{x^3}{4}+\\frac{x}{2}+\\frac{C}{x}$。",
            "代入初值$x=1,y=1$：$1=\\frac{1}{4}+\\frac{1}{2}+C$，即$1=\\frac{3}{4}+C$，解得$C=\\frac{1}{4}$。",
            "所以特解为$y=\\frac{x^3}{4}+\\frac{x}{2}+\\frac{1}{4x}$。",
            "验算：当$x=1$时，$y=\\frac14+\\frac12+\\frac14=1$，满足初值；且该函数是一般解的特例，自动满足原方程。"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "osaka-2022-c07cb3c8db-q01-practice-03",
      "school": "大阪大学",
      "year": "2022"
    },
    {
      "text": "求微分方程$x^2\\dfrac{dy}{dx}+2xy=x^4+x^2,\\ x>0$的一般解。",
      "knowledge_points": [
        "一阶线性常微分方程",
        "恰当形式的推广（$(x^2y)'$）",
        "不定积分"
      ],
      "question_type": "一阶线性微分方程求通解（推广形式）",
      "method": [
        "识别左边为$(x^2y)'$",
        "积分求解"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "化为$(x^2y)'=x^4+x^2$",
        "积分得$x^2y=\\frac{x^5}{5}+\\frac{x^3}{3}+C$",
        "解出$y$"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "first_order_linear_ode_generalized",
        "template": "x^2y'+2xy=x^4+x^2,\\ x>0",
        "variable_count": 1
      },
      "difficulty": 3,
      "estimated_minutes": 6,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "一般解",
          "steps": [
            "注意$\\frac{d}{dx}(x^2y)=2xy+x^2y'$，恰为方程左边，故方程化为$(x^2y)'=x^4+x^2$。",
            "两边积分：$x^2y=\\int(x^4+x^2)\\,dx=\\frac{x^5}{5}+\\frac{x^3}{3}+C$。",
            "除以$x^2$（$x>0$）得$y=\\frac{x^3}{5}+\\frac{x}{3}+\\frac{C}{x^2}$。",
            "验算：$y'=\\frac{3x^2}{5}+\\frac13-\\frac{2C}{x^3}$，代入$x^2y'+2xy=x^2\\left(\\frac{3x^2}{5}+\\frac13-\\frac{2C}{x^3}\\right)+2x\\left(\\frac{x^3}{5}+\\frac{x}{3}+\\frac{C}{x^2}\\right)=\\frac{3x^4}{5}+\\frac{x^2}{3}-\\frac{2C}{x}+\\frac{2x^4}{5}+\\frac{2x^2}{3}+\\frac{2C}{x}=x^4+x^2$，成立。"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "osaka-2022-c07cb3c8db-q01-practice-04",
      "school": "大阪大学",
      "year": "2022"
    }
